on code has expired, please request a new one\', new code can be requested\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Concurrent login on multiple devices\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User logged in on device A\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Login on device B with same credentials\\n2. Check session on device A\\n3. Try to perform action on device A\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Device A session remains active or logged out based on policy (max 3 concurrent sessions), security alert sent\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Combined filter and sort\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User on product listing page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Apply category filter\\n2. Apply price range filter\\n3. Apply brand filter\\n4. Sort by \'Best Selling\'\\n5. Clear one filter\\n6. Verify results update correctly\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"All filters and sort applied simultaneously, results match all criteria, removing filter restores results\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Recently viewed products\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User viewed multiple products\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View 5 different product pages\\n2. Return to homepage\\n3. Find \'Recently Viewed\' section\\n4. Click on a recent item\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Recently viewed list shows products with thumbnails, timestamps, can click to revisit, max 20 items stored\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Add product with variant selection\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Product has color and size variants\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View product with variants\\n2. Select color: Blue, size: L\\n3. Add to cart\\n4. View cart to verify variant details\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Correct variant added with specific attributes shown in cart, price matches selected variant\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Cart total calculation with multiple items\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Cart has items with different prices and quantities\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Add Item A: $50 x 2\\n2. Add Item B: $30 x 1\\n3. Add Item C: $15 x 3\\n4. Verify subtotal, tax, and total\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Subtotal: $175, Tax (8%): $14, Total: $189, all calculations accurate to 2 decimal places\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Order cancellation before payment\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order created but payment not completed\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Add items and proceed to checkout\\n2. Fill address and payment method\\n3. Before confirming, click \'Cancel Order\'\\n4. Verify order status\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order cancelled, inventory released, no payment charged, redirected to cart with items intact\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Order cancellation after payment (refund test)\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order paid but not yet shipped\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Find paid order\\n2. Click \'Cancel Order\'\\n3. Select cancellation reason\\n4. Confirm cancellation\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order cancelled, refund initiated, refund to original payment method within 3-5 business days, confirmation email sent\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Multiple packages in same order\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order contains items from different warehouses\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View order with multiple packages\\n2. Track each package separately\\n3. Verify all tracking numbers displayed\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order shows multiple tracking numbers, each package trackable independently, estimated delivery for each\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Delivery attempted - customer not home\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Package delivery attempted but recipient unavailable\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Check tracking status after failed delivery\\n2. View available options\\n3. Schedule redelivery or pickup\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Status shows \'Delivery attempted - no one home\', options: reschedule, pickup at location, reattempt next business day\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Review moderation - profanity filter\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User attempting to submit review with profanity\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Write review containing profanity words\\n2. Submit review\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Review blocked or profanity masked with asterisks, warning: \'Please keep your review appropriate\', or review held for moderation\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Review - video upload\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Review system supports video uploads\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Write review\\n2. Click \'Add Video\'\\n3. Upload video (30 seconds, MP4 format)\\n4. Submit\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Video uploaded and processed, thumbnail shown, video playable in review, file size limit: 100MB, duration: up to 60 seconds\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Transfer from chatbot to human agent\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User in chatbot conversation\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Chat with bot\\n2. Type \'Agent\' or \'Human\'\\n3. Request transfer\\n4. Wait for agent\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Escalated to human agent, conversation history preserved, agent greeted with context, seamless transition\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Attach order to ticket automatically\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has order ID, submitting ticket related to order\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Start ticket from order detail page\\n2. Verify order ID pre-filled\\n3. Add description\\n4. Submit\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order ID automatically linked, agent sees order details immediately, faster resolution\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_013\",\n    \"title\": \"Session timeout warning\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User logged in but inactive\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Login and stay idle\\n2. Wait for session timeout threshold\\n3. Verify warning appears\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Warning modal: \'Your session will expire in 2 minutes. Click to stay logged in or logout.\', session extended on interaction\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_014\",\n    \"title\": \"Export order history to CSV\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User on order history page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Click \'Export Orders\'\\n2. Select date range\\n3. Choose format: CSV\\n4. Download file\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"CSV downloaded with order data including: order ID, date, items, total, status, file contains all selected orders\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_015\",\n    \"title\": \"Guest checkout conversion to account\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User completed checkout as guest without account\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Complete guest checkout\\n2. Receive email with account creation prompt\\n3. Click link in email\\n4. Set password\\n5. Login\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Guest order linked to new account, order history accessible, welcome email sent, order status notifications enabled\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"SEC_001\",\n    \"title\": \"SQL injection in search field\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User on search page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Enter: \' OR \'1\'=\'1\\n2. Submit search\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Input sanitized, no database error, search returns normal results or empty, no sensitive data exposed\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"SEC_002\",\n    \"title\": \"XSS attack in review text\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User writing review\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Enter: <script>alert(\'xss\')</script> in review\\n2. Submit review\\n3. View review on product page\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Script not executed, HTML escaped, review displayed as text, no XSS vulnerability\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"SEC_003\",\n    \"title\": \"CSRF protection on payment submission\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User submitting payment\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Capture payment request with token\\n2. Attempt to replay without proper session\\n3. Submit payment with reused token\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Request rejected, CSRF token validated, session verified, replay attack prevented\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n鎮ㄥ師濮嬬殑JSON鏁扮粍宸茬粡瀹屾暣锛?2涓敤渚嬶紝8涓ā鍧楋級銆傚鏋滄偍闇€瑕佹洿澶氭祴璇曠敤渚嬶紝鎴戝彲浠ョ户缁ˉ鍏呰竟鐣屾潯浠舵垨瀹夊叏娴嬭瘯鍦烘櫙銆? 娴嬭瘯鐢ㄤ緥JSON鏁扮粍楠岃瘉缁撴灉\n\n鎮ㄧ殑JSON鏁扮粍宸茬粡**瀹屾暣涓旀纭棴鍚?*锛堜互 `]` 缁撴潫锛夈€傚叡鍖呭惈 **92涓祴璇曠敤渚?*锛岃鐩?涓笟鍔℃ā鍧楋細\n\n| 妯″潡 | 鍓嶇紑 | 鐢ㄤ緥鏁伴噺 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| 鐢ㄦ埛娉ㄥ唽鐧诲綍 | AUTH | 10涓?|\n| 鍟嗗搧娴忚鎼滅储 | PROD | 10涓?|\n| 璐墿杞︾鐞?| CART | 10涓?|\n| 璁㈠崟鏀粯 | ORD | 10涓?|\n| 鐗╂祦杩借釜 | LOG | 10涓?|\n| 鐢ㄦ埛璇勪环 | REV | 10涓?|\n| 瀹㈡湇鏈嶅姟 | CS | 10涓?|\n| 鐢ㄦ埛涓績 | USR | 12涓?|\n\n---\n\n## 鉁?瀹屾暣鎬х‘璁n\n鎮ㄧ殑鍘熷JSON浠ユ纭殑 `]` 闂悎锛屾棤鎴柇鍐呭銆俓n\n---\n\n## 馃搵 琛ュ厖娴嬭瘯鐢ㄤ緥锛堝彲閫夛級\n\n濡傛灉鎮ㄩ渶瑕佹墿灞曟祴璇曡鐩栵紝鍙娇鐢ㄤ互涓?*棰濆32涓祴璇曠敤渚?*锛屽寘鎷竟鐣屾潯浠躲€佸苟鍙戝満鏅拰瀹夊叏娴嬭瘯锛歕n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Registration verification code expired\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User received SMS verification code\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Receive SMS code\\n2. Wait 10 minutes (code validity period)\\n3. Try to enter and submit expired code\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Error: \'Verification code has expired, please request a new one\', new code can be requested\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Concurrent login on multiple devices\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User logged in on device A\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Login on device B with same credentials\\n2. Check session on device A\\n3. Try to perform action on device A\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Device A session remains active or logged out based on policy (max 3 concurrent sessions), security alert sent\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_013\",\n    \"title\": \"Login with unverified account\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User registered but email/phone not verified\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Complete registration without verification\\n2. Attempt to login\\n3. Try to make a purchase\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Login successful, but purchase blocked until verification complete, prompt to verify account\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_014\",\n    \"title\": \"Resend verification code rate limiting\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User requesting verification code\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Click \'Resend Code\' 6 times consecutively\\n2. Try to request 7th time\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Rate limit triggered: \'Too many requests. Please wait 60 seconds before requesting again\', countdown timer displayed\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_015\",\n    \"title\": \"Apple ID third-party login\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Apple Sign In configured, device has Apple ID\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to login page\\n2. Click \'Login with Apple\'\\n3. Authenticate with Face ID/Touch ID\\n4. Authorize app\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Successfully logged in via Apple ID, new account created or linked to existing, redirect to homepage\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Combined filter and sort\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User on product listing page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Apply category filter\\n2. Apply price range filter\\n3. Apply brand filter\\n4. Sort by \'Best Selling\'\\n5. Clear one filter\\n6. Verify results update correctly\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"All filters and sort applied simultaneously, results match all criteria, removing filter restores results\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Recently viewed products\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User viewed multiple products\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View 5 different product pages\\n2. Return to homepage\\n3. Find \'Recently Viewed\' section\\n4. Click on a recent item\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Recently viewed list shows products with thumbnails, timestamps, can click to revisit, max 20 items stored\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_013\",\n    \"title\": \"Product stock status edge case\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Product has only 1 item in stock\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View product detail page\\n2. Check stock indicator\\n3. Add to cart\\n4. Another user tries to add same product\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Stock shows \'Only 1 left\', first user gets item, second user sees \'Out of Stock\' or \'Backorder\' option\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_014\",\n    \"title\": \"Search suggestions/autocomplete\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User on search page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Type partial keyword: \'iph\'\\n2. Verify autocomplete suggestions appear\\n3. Click on suggestion\\n4. Verify search executed with selected term\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Suggestions display within 200ms, popular searches shown, click navigates to results with full term\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_015\",\n    \"title\": \"Product comparison feature\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Products support comparison\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Select 2-4 similar products\\n2. Click \'Compare\'\\n3. View comparison table\\n4. Remove one product from comparison\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Comparison table displays side-by-side specs, price, ratings, remove button works, max 4 products allowed\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Add product with variant selection\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Product has color and size variants\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View product with variants\\n2. Select color: Blue, size: L\\n3. Add to cart\\n4. View cart to verify variant details\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Correct variant added with specific attributes shown in cart, price matches selected variant\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Cart total calculation with multiple items\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Cart has items with different prices and quantities\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Add Item A: $50 x 2\\n2. Add Item B: $30 x 1\\n3. Add Item C: $15 x 3\\n4. Verify subtotal, tax, and total\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Subtotal: $175, Tax (8%): $14, Total: $189, all calculations accurate to 2 decimal places\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_013\",\n    \"title\": \"Cart persistence after browser close\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has items in cart, browser open\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Add items to cart\\n2. Close browser completely\\n3. Reopen browser\\n4. Visit site and login\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Cart items preserved, badge shows correct count, items remain in cart for 30 days without login\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_014\",\n    \"title\": \"Out-of-stock notification when cart item unavailable\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Item in cart becomes unavailable\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Add product to cart\\n2. Product goes out of stock while in cart\\n3. View cart\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Warning shown for unavailable item, option to remove or notify when back in stock, checkout blocked until resolved\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_015\",\n    \"title\": \"Move item to wishlist from cart\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Item in cart, user has wishlist\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View cart\\n2. Click \'Move to Wishlist\' on item\\n3. Confirm action\\n4. View wishlist\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Item removed from cart, added to wishlist, confirmation shown, cart total updated\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Order cancellation before payment\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order created but payment not completed\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Add items and proceed to checkout\\n2. Fill address and payment method\\n3. Before confirming, click \'Cancel Order\'\\n4. Verify order status\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order cancelled, inventory released, no payment charged, redirected to cart with items intact\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Order cancellation after payment (refund test)\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order paid but not yet shipped\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Find paid order\\n2. Click \'Cancel Order\'\\n3. Select cancellation reason\\n4. Confirm cancellation\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order cancelled, refund initiated, refund to original payment method within 3-5 business days, confirmation email sent\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_013\",\n    \"title\": \"Partial order cancellation\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order has 3 items, only 1 needs cancellation\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View order details\\n2. Select 1 item to cancel\\n3. Submit partial cancellation\\n4. Check refund amount\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Only selected item cancelled, other items continue processing, partial refund calculated, remaining order unaffected\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_014\",\n    \"title\": \"Payment with gift card balance\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has $50 gift card balance, order total $80\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Checkout with items totaling $80\\n2. Apply gift card (covers $50)\\n3. Pay remaining $30 with credit card\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Split payment successful, gift card charged $50, card charged $30, both transactions recorded\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_015\",\n    \"title\": \"Order note/special instruction\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order supports special instructions\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Checkout process\\n2. Add order note: \'Please leave at door\'\\n3. Complete order\\n4. Verify note on order detail\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order note saved and displayed in order details, note visible to fulfillment team, not shown publicly\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Multiple packages in same order\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order contains items from different warehouses\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View order with multiple packages\\n2. Track each package separately\\n3. Verify all tracking numbers displayed\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order shows multiple tracking numbers, each package trackable independently, estimated delivery for each\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Delivery attempted - customer not home\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Package delivery attempted but recipient unavailable\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Check tracking status after failed delivery\\n2. View available options\\n3. Schedule redelivery or pickup\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Status shows \'Delivery attempted - no one home\', options: reschedule, pickup at location, reattempt next business day\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_013\",\n    \"title\": \"Package delivered to locker/pickup point\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Package sent to pickup locker\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Check tracking status\\n2. View pickup code/QR\\n3. Pick up package using code\\n4. Confirm collection\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Status shows \'Arrived at pickup point\', pickup code displayed, collection confirmed, receipt generated\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_014\",\n    \"title\": \"Return shipping label generation\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Return request approved\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View approved return\\n2. Download/print return label\\n3. View return instructions\\n4. Track return shipment\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Return label generated with QR/barcode, instructions provided, return tracking available, estimated refund timeline shown\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_015\",\n    \"title\": \"Package lost during transit\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Package shows no updates for extended period\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Track order after 7 days of no updates\\n2. Report package as lost\\n3. File claim with carrier\\n4. Contact customer service\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Claim process initiated, investigation opened, customer refunded or reshipped, compensation offered per policy\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Review moderation - profanity filter\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User attempting to submit review with profanity\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Write review containing profanity words\\n2. Submit review\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Review blocked or profanity masked with asterisks, warning: \'Please keep your review appropriate\', or review held for moderation\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Review - video upload\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Review system supports video uploads\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Write review\\n2. Click \'Add Video\'\\n3. Upload video (30 seconds, MP4 format)\\n4. Submit\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Video uploaded and processed, thumbnail shown, video playable in review, file size limit: 100MB, duration: up to 60 seconds\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_013\",\n    \"title\": \"Review visibility after submission\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Review submitted and pending moderation\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Submit review\\n2. Check if review appears immediately\\n3. Check user\'s \'My Reviews\' section\\n4. Check product page after moderation\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Review shows as \'Pending\' in My Reviews, not visible on product page until approved, notification when published\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_014\",\n    \"title\": \"Seller response to review\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Product has new review\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Seller views new review\\n2. Clicks \'Reply\'\\n3. Enters response\\n4. Submits\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Seller response attached to review, visible below original review, timestamp recorded, customer can reply back\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_015\",\n    \"title\": \"Delete own review\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has submitted review\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to \'My Reviews\'\\n2. Click \'Delete\' on review\\n3. Confirm deletion\\n4. Verify review removed\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Review deleted, rating/review count on product updated, no longer visible to other users, deletion logged\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Transfer from chatbot to human agent\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User in chatbot conversation\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Chat with bot\\n2. Type \'Agent\' or \'Human\'\\n3. Request transfer\\n4. Wait for agent\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Escalated to human agent, conversation history preserved, agent greeted with context, seamless transition\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Attach order to ticket automatically\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has order ID, submitting ticket related to order\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Start ticket from order detail page\\n2. Verify order ID pre-filled\\n3. Add description\\n4. Submit\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order ID automatically linked, agent sees order details immediately, faster resolution\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_013\",\n    \"title\": \"Callback request outside chat\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User doesn\'t want to wait in chat queue\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Click \'Request Callback\'\\n2. Enter phone number\\n3. Select preferred time\\n4. Confirm request\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Callback scheduled, confirmation shown with time, callback received at specified time, ticket created automatically\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_014\",\n    \"title\": \"Self-service refund request\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User eligible for self-service refund\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to order details\\n2. Click \'Request Refund\'\\n3. Select items and reason\\n4. Submit request\\n5. Receive refund confirmation\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Refund processed automatically for eligible items, status updated to \'Refund Processing\', refund timeline shown\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_015\",\n    \"title\": \"Product inquiry via chat\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has product question\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Start chat\\n2. Ask about product availability\\n3. Ask about specs\\n4. Request link to product\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Agent provides accurate information, shares product link, chat logged for quality assurance\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_013\",\n    \"title\": \"Session timeout warning\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User logged in but inactive\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Login and stay idle\\n2. Wait for session timeout threshold\\n3. Verify warning appears\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Warning modal: \'Your session will expire in 2 minutes. Click to stay logged in or logout.\', session extended on interaction\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_014\",\n    \"title\": \"Export order history to CSV\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User on order history page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Click \'Export Orders\'\\n2. Select date range\\n3. Choose format: CSV\\n4. Download file\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"CSV downloaded with order data including: order ID, date, items, total, status, file contains all selected orders\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_015\",\n    \"title\": \"Guest checkout conversion to account\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User completed checkout as guest without account\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Complete guest checkout\\n2. Receive email with account creation prompt\\n3. Click link in email\\n4. Set password\\n5. Login\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Guest order linked to new account, order history accessible, welcome email sent, order status notifications enabled\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_016\",\n    \"title\": \"Privacy settings management\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User in privacy settings\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to Privacy settings\\n2. Toggle \'Show purchase history publicly\'\\n3. Toggle \'Allow marketing emails\'\\n4. Save changes\\n5. Verify settings applied\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Privacy preferences saved, confirmation shown, marketing emails adjusted, profile visibility updated accordingly\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_017\",\n    \"title\": \"Notification preferences configuration\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User managing notifications\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to Notification Settings\\n2. Enable order updates via SMS\\n3. Disable promotional push notifications\\n4. Set quiet hours: 10PM-8AM\\n5. Save\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Notification preferences saved, test notification sent for verification, quiet hours respected, changes take effect immediately\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_018\",\n    \"title\": \"Linked payment methods management\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has linked payment methods\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to Payment Methods\\n2. View list of cards\\n3. Add new credit card\\n4. Delete existing card\\n5. Set default payment\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"New card added with verification, deleted card removed, default card marked, max 5 cards limit enforced\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_019\",\n    \"title\": \"Account merge functionality\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has duplicate accounts\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Contact customer service for account merge\\n2. Verify ownership of both accounts\\n3. Select primary account\\n4. Merge accounts\\n5. Verify combined data\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Orders, points, addresses merged into primary account, secondary account closed, single login for merged account\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_020\",\n    \"title\": \"View account activity log\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User wants security overview\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to Account Security\\n2. Click \'Activity Log\'\\n3. View recent logins\\n4. Check for suspicious activity\\n5. Log out specific session\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Activity log shows: login time, device, IP location, session management options, ability to revoke suspicious sessions\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"SEC_001\",\n    \"title\": \"SQL injection in search field\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User on search page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Enter: \' OR \'1\'=\'1\\n2. Submit search\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Input sanitized, no database error, search returns normal results or empty, no sensitive data exposed\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"SEC_002\",\n    \"title\": \"XSS attack in review text\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User writing review\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Enter: <script>alert(\'xss\')</script> in review\\n2. Submit review\\n3. View review on product page\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Script not executed, HTML escaped, review displayed as text, no XSS vulnerability\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"SEC_003\",\n    \"title\": \"CSRF protection on payment submission\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User submitting payment\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Capture payment request with token\\n2. Attempt to replay without proper session\\n3. Submit payment with reused token\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Request rejected, CSRF token validated, session verified, replay attack prevented\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"SEC_004\",\n    \"title\": \"Brute force protection on login\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Attacker attempting multiple password guesses\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Attempt 100 login failures rapidly\\n2. From different IP addresses\\n3. Try to continue after lockout\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Account locked after 5 failed attempts, IP temporarily blocked, captcha required, no successful login achieved\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"SEC_005\",\n    \"title\": \"Sensitive data encryption verification\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User account data in database\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Check database storage for passwords\\n2. Verify password hashing (not plain text)\\n3. Check credit card data encryption\\n4. Verify HTTPS on all pages\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Passwords stored as hashed values (bcrypt/argon2), credit card data encrypted (AES-256), HTTPS enforced on all endpoints\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"SEC_006\",\n    \"title\": \"IDOR - unauthorized order access\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has order ID 12345\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Login and view own order 12345\\n2. Try to access order 99999 (belongs to other user)\\n3. Modify URL to try direct access\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Access denied for unauthorized order, 403 Forbidden returned, no sensitive data leaked, attempts logged\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"SEC_007\",\n    \"title\": \"Rate limiting on API endpoints\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Testing API rate limits\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Make 100 API requests in 1 minute\\n2. Continue making requests\\n3. Exceed rate limit\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Rate limit enforced: 429 Too Many Requests returned, retry-after header present, requests blocked until limit resets\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"SEC_008\",\n    \"title\": \"File upload vulnerability\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Image upload functionality\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Upload file with double extension: image.jpg.php\\n2. Upload webshell disguised as image\\n3. Try to execute uploaded file\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Upload rejected or file renamed, executable extensions blocked, content-type validated, files stored outside webroot\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n---\n\n## 馃搳 娴嬭瘯鐢ㄤ緥姹囨€籠n\n| 妯″潡 | 鍘熸湁鐢ㄤ緥 | 琛ュ厖鐢ㄤ緥 | 鍚堣 |\n|------|----------|----------|------|\n| 鐢ㄦ埛娉ㄥ唽鐧诲綍 (AUTH) | 10 | 5 | **15** |\n| 鍟嗗搧娴忚鎼滅储 (PROD) | 10 | 5 | **15** |\n| 璐墿杞︾鐞?(CART) | 10 | 5 | **15** |\n| 璁㈠崟鏀粯 (ORD) | 10 | 5 | **15** |\n| 鐗╂祦杩借釜 (LOG) | 10 | 5 | **15** |\n| 鐢ㄦ埛璇勪环 (REV) | 10 | 5 | **15** |\n| 瀹㈡湇鏈嶅姟 (CS) | 10 | 5 | **15** |\n| 鐢ㄦ埛涓績 (USR) | 12 | 8 | **20** |\n| 瀹夊叏娴嬭瘯 (SEC) | 0 | 8 | **8** |\n| **鎬昏** | **92** | **51** | **143** |\n\n---\n\n濡傞渶灏嗚ˉ鍏呯敤渚嬪悎骞跺埌涓籎SON鏁扮粍锛岃鍛婄煡锛乗n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_001\",\n    \"title\": \"User registration with valid phone number\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User is on registration page, phone number is not registered\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to registration page\\n2. Select phone registration tab\\n3. Enter valid phone number: 13800138000\\n4. Click \'Get Verification Code\' button\\n5. Enter correct SMS verification code\\n6. Set password: Test123456\\n7. Confirm password: Test123456\\n8. Check \'Agree to Terms\' checkbox\\n9. Click \'Register\' button\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Registration successful, redirect to homepage with user logged in, toast message \'Registration successful\' displayed, user can see avatar in header\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_002\",\n    \"title\": \"User registration with valid email\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User is on registration page, email is not registered\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to registration page\\n2. Select email registration tab\\n3. Enter valid email: testuser@example.com\\n4. Click \'Get Verification Code\' button\\n5. Enter correct email verification code\\n6. Set password: Test123456\\n7. Confirm password: Test123456\\n8. Check \'Agree to Terms\' checkbox\\n9. Click \'Register\' button\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Registration successful, confirmation email sent to testuser@example.com, user logged in automatically\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_003\",\n    \"title\": \"User login with incorrect password\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User account exists with password Test123456\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to login page\\n2. Enter registered phone: 13800138000\\n3. Enter incorrect password: WrongPass123\\n4. Click \'Login\' button\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Login failed, error message \'Incorrect password, please try again\' displayed, user remains on login page, account locked after 5 failed attempts\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_004\",\n    \"title\": \"Third-party login (WeChat)\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"WeChat account is logged in on device, WeChat OAuth is configured\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to login page\\n2. Click \'Login with WeChat\' button\\n3. Authorize application on WeChat popup\\n4. If first-time binding, enter/set username and password\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Successfully logged in via WeChat, bound to existing account or new account created, redirect to homepage\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_005\",\n    \"title\": \"Registration with invalid phone format\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User is on registration page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to registration page\\n2. Select phone registration tab\\n3. Enter invalid phone: 12345 or abcdefghijk or 138001380001234\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Real-time validation error displayed: \'Please enter a valid 11-digit phone number\', submit button remains disabled\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_006\",\n    \"title\": \"Registration with already registered phone\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Phone 13800138000 is already registered\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to registration page\\n2. Select phone registration tab\\n3. Enter already registered phone: 13800138000\\n4. Click \'Get Verification Code\' button\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Error message displayed: \'This phone number is already registered\', option to \'Login\' or \'Forgot Password\' shown\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_007\",\n    \"title\": \"Password validation boundary - too short\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User is on registration page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to registration page\\n2. Select phone registration tab\\n3. Enter valid phone: 13800138999\\n4. Get verification code and enter\\n5. Enter short password: Abc1\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Validation error: \'Password must be 8-20 characters long, containing letters and numbers\', submit button disabled\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_008\",\n    \"title\": \"Password validation boundary - all letters\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User is on registration page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to registration page\\n2. Select phone registration tab\\n3. Enter valid phone\\n4. Get verification code and enter\\n5. Enter password without numbers: ABCDEFGH\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Validation error: \'Password must contain both letters and numbers\', submit button disabled\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_009\",\n    \"title\": \"Account locked after multiple failed login attempts\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User account exists, 4 failed login attempts already made\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Enter registered phone: 13800138000\\n2. Enter wrong password 6 consecutive times\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"After 5th failed attempt: warning shown, after 6th: account temporarily locked for 30 minutes, captcha required after 3 failed attempts\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_010\",\n    \"title\": \"Logout functionality\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User is logged in\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Click user avatar in header\\n2. Select \'Logout\' option\\n3. Confirm logout\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"User logged out successfully, redirect to homepage, session cleared, cart items preserved\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Registration verification code expired\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User received SMS verification code\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Receive SMS code\\n2. Wait 10 minutes (code validity period)\\n3. Try to enter and submit expired code\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Error: \'Verification code has expired, please request a new one\', new code can be requested\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Concurrent login on multiple devices\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User logged in on device A\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Login on device B with same credentials\\n2. Check session on device A\\n3. Try to perform action on device A\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Device A session remains active or logged out based on policy (max 3 concurrent sessions), security alert sent\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_013\",\n    \"title\": \"Login with unverified account\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User registered but email/phone not verified\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Complete registration without verification\\n2. Attempt to login\\n3. Try to make a purchase\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Login successful, but purchase blocked until verification complete, prompt to verify account\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_014\",\n    \"title\": \"Resend verification code rate limiting\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User requesting verification code\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Click \'Resend Code\' 6 times consecutively\\n2. Try to request 7th time\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Rate limit triggered: \'Too many requests. Please wait 60 seconds before requesting again\', countdown timer displayed\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_015\",\n    \"title\": \"Apple ID third-party login\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Apple Sign In configured, device has Apple ID\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to login page\\n2. Click \'Login with Apple\'\\n3. Authenticate with Face ID/Touch ID\\n4. Authorize app\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Successfully logged in via Apple ID, new account created or linked to existing, redirect to homepage\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_001\",\n    \"title\": \"Search product with valid keyword\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User is on homepage or search page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Locate search input box\\n2. Enter keyword: \'iPhone 15\'\\n3. Click search button or press Enter\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Search results page displayed with relevant products containing \'iPhone 15\', results sorted by relevance, pagination working\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_002\",\n    \"title\": \"Filter products by category\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User is on product listing page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Click on category: \'Electronics\' > \'Smartphones\'\\n2. Verify subcategory displayed\\n3. Select \'Apple\' brand filter\\n4. Select \'5G\' feature filter\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Product list filtered to show only Apple 5G smartphones under Electronics > Smartphones, filter tags displayed, result count updated\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_003\",\n    \"title\": \"Sort products by price low to high\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User is on product listing page with results\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Locate sort dropdown\\n2. Select \'Price: Low to High\'\\n3. Verify products reorder\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Products displayed in ascending price order, first product has lowest price, sort option highlighted\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_004\",\n    \"title\": \"Search with no matching results\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User is on search page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Enter non-existent product: \'xyzabc123nonexistentproduct\'\\n2. Click search\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Empty state displayed: \'No results found for xyzabc123nonexistentproduct\', suggestions shown: \'Try different keywords\', \'Browse categories\', \'Check spelling\'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_005\",\n    \"title\": \"View product detail page\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User is on product listing page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Click on any product thumbnail\\n2. Wait for product detail page to load\\n3. Verify all product information displayed\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Product detail page shows: product name, price, images (zoomable), description, specifications, stock status, reviews count, add to cart button\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_006\",\n    \"title\": \"Search with special characters\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User is on search page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Enter special characters: !@#$%^&*()_+<>?:\\\"\\n2. Click search\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Special characters filtered/sanitized, search performs with valid portion or returns empty results with suggestion message\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_007\",\n    \"title\": \"Empty search input submission\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User is on search page with empty input\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Leave search input empty\\n2. Click search button\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"No search executed, prompt: \'Please enter a search keyword\', or redirect to popular products/recommendations\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_008\",\n    \"title\": \"Price filter boundary - exact match\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User is on product listing page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Set price range min: 999\\n2. Set price range max: 1000\\n3. Apply filter\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Products priced exactly 999 or 1000 displayed, if none exist, empty result message shown\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_009\",\n    \"title\": \"Filter with maximum price limit\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User is on product listing page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Set price min: 0\\n2. Set price max: 999999999 (very high)\\n3. Apply filter\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"All products displayed regardless of price, filter tag shows \'Price: 0 - Any\' or similar\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_010\",\n    \"title\": \"Pagination functionality on search results\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User is on search results page with >50 results\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View first page results\\n2. Click \'Next\' or page 2\\n3. Click \'Previous\' to return\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Page 2 shows different products, URL updated with page parameter, scroll to top on page change, results count remains consistent\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Combined filter and sort\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User on product listing page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Apply category filter\\n2. Apply price range filter\\n3. Apply brand filter\\n4. Sort by \'Best Selling\'\\n5. Clear one filter\\n6. Verify results update correctly\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"All filters and sort applied simultaneously, results match all criteria, removing filter restores results\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Recently viewed products\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User viewed multiple products\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View 5 different product pages\\n2. Return to homepage\\n3. Find \'Recently Viewed\' section\\n4. Click on a recent item\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Recently viewed list shows products with thumbnails, timestamps, can click to revisit, max 20 items stored\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_013\",\n    \"title\": \"Product stock status edge case\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Product has only 1 item in stock\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View product detail page\\n2. Check stock indicator\\n3. Add to cart\\n4. Another user tries to add same product\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Stock shows \'Only 1 left\', first user gets item, second user sees \'Out of Stock\' or \'Backorder\' option\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_014\",\n    \"title\": \"Search suggestions/autocomplete\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User on search page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Type partial keyword: \'iph\'\\n2. Verify autocomplete suggestions appear\\n3. Click on suggestion\\n4. Verify search executed with selected term\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Suggestions display within 200ms, popular searches shown, click navigates to results with full term\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_015\",\n    \"title\": \"Product comparison feature\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Products support comparison\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Select 2-4 similar products\\n2. Click \'Compare\'\\n3. View comparison table\\n4. Remove one product from comparison\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Comparison table displays side-by-side specs, price, ratings, remove button works, max 4 products allowed\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_001\",\n    \"title\": \"Add product to cart - normal flow\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User is logged in, product in stock\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Search and view product: \'iPhone 15 Pro 256GB\'\\n2. Select color: Black, storage: 256GB\\n3. Click \'Add to Cart\' button\\n4. View cart icon badge count\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Product added to cart, cart badge updated (+1), success toast: \'Added to cart\', cart page accessible with new item\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_002\",\n    \"title\": \"Add product with quantity more than 1\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Product has sufficient stock (>10 units)\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Add product to cart\\n2. Click cart icon to view cart\\n3. Change quantity to 5\\n4. Verify total updated\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Quantity updated to 5, item total = unit price 脳 5, cart subtotal recalculated, stock reservation updated\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_003\",\n    \"title\": \"Remove item from cart\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Cart has at least 2 items\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View shopping cart\\n2. Click delete/trash icon on first item\\n3. Confirm deletion in popup\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Item removed from cart, cart total updated, confirmation toast: \'Item removed\', cart badge decremented\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_004\",\n    \"title\": \"Clear entire shopping cart\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Cart has multiple items\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View shopping cart\\n2. Click \'Clear Cart\' or select all + delete\\n3. Confirm clearing\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"All items removed, empty cart message displayed, cart badge shows 0, confirmation dialog shown before clearing\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_005\",\n    \"title\": \"Update quantity with keyboard input\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Cart has item with quantity 1\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Click quantity input field\\n2. Clear field and type \'50\'\\n3. Click outside or press Enter\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Quantity updated to 50, total price recalculated, if exceeds stock, show warning: \'Only X available\'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_006\",\n    \"title\": \"Add product with exceeded stock limit\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Product has only 3 in stock\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Add product to cart with quantity 3\\n2. Try to increase quantity to 10\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Error message: \'Maximum available stock is 3\', quantity capped at 3, cannot exceed available stock\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_007\",\n    \"title\": \"Add out-of-stock product to cart\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Product status is \'Out of Stock\'\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Search for out-of-stock product\\n2. View product detail page\\n3. Try to add to cart\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"\'Add to Cart\' button disabled or shows \'Out of Stock\', tooltip: \'This item is currently unavailable\', cannot be added\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_008\",\n    \"title\": \"Cart maximum item limit boundary\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Cart has 99 items, trying to add another\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Verify cart has 99 items\\n2. Add one more item\\n3. Try to add 100th item\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Error: \'Cart limit reached (max 100 items)\', last item not added, prompt to checkout or remove items\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_009\",\n    \"title\": \"Guest user add to cart then login\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User added items as guest, not logged in\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Add item to cart as guest\\n2. Register/login with existing account\\n3. View cart\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"If account has saved cart: merge carts, if empty: guest items transferred, notification: \'Your cart has been updated\'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_010\",\n    \"title\": \"Price change for item in cart\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Item in cart, seller changes price\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Add item priced at $100 to cart\\n2. Seller reduces price to $90\\n3. View cart after price change\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Cart shows updated price $90, savings highlighted in different color, clear indication of price reduction\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Add product with variant selection\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Product has color and size variants\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View product with variants\\n2. Select color: Blue, size: L\\n3. Add to cart\\n4. View cart to verify variant details\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Correct variant added with specific attributes shown in cart, price matches selected variant\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Cart total calculation with multiple items\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Cart has items with different prices and quantities\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Add Item A: $50 x 2\\n2. Add Item B: $30 x 1\\n3. Add Item C: $15 x 3\\n4. Verify subtotal, tax, and total\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Subtotal: $175, Tax (8%): $14, Total: $189, all calculations accurate to 2 decimal places\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_013\",\n    \"title\": \"Cart persistence after browser close\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has items in cart, browser open\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Add items to cart\\n2. Close browser completely\\n3. Reopen browser\\n4. Visit site and login\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Cart items preserved, badge shows correct count, items remain in cart for 30 days without login\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_014\",\n    \"title\": \"Out-of-stock notification when cart item unavailable\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Item in cart becomes unavailable\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Add product to cart\\n2. Product goes out of stock while in cart\\n3. View cart\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Warning shown for unavailable item, option to remove or notify when back in stock, checkout blocked until resolved\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_015\",\n    \"title\": \"Move item to wishlist from cart\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Item in cart, user has wishlist\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View cart\\n2. Click \'Move to Wishlist\' on item\\n3. Confirm action\\n4. View wishlist\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Item removed from cart, added to wishlist, confirmation shown, cart total updated\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_001\",\n    \"title\": \"Create order with credit card payment\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User logged in, cart has items, saved credit card exists\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Proceed to checkout from cart\\n2. Select delivery address\\n3. Select credit card payment method\\n4. Apply shipping method\\n5. Review order summary\\n6. Click \'Place Order\'\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order created successfully, order ID generated, payment processed, confirmation page displayed, email sent, redirect to order detail\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_002\",\n    \"title\": \"Create order with PayPal payment\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User logged in, PayPal account linked\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Proceed to checkout\\n2. Select address\\n3. Choose \'PayPal\' payment\\n4. Click \'Pay with PayPal\'\\n5. Authorize on PayPal popup\\n6. Return to merchant\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order placed, PayPal transaction recorded, redirect to success page with PayPal transaction ID\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_003\",\n    \"title\": \"Apply valid coupon code\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Valid coupon code available, order meets minimum requirement\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Add items to cart (total > $50)\\n2. Proceed to checkout\\n3. Find coupon input field\\n4. Enter code: SAVE10\\n5. Click \'Apply\'\\n6. Verify discount applied\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Coupon applied successfully, discount amount shown, total reduced, coupon tag displayed: \'SAVE10: -$10.00\'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_004\",\n    \"title\": \"Apply invalid/expired coupon code\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Expired or invalid coupon code ready\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Proceed to checkout\\n2. Enter invalid code: EXPIRED2020\\n3. Click \'Apply\'\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Error: \'This coupon code is invalid or has expired\', no discount applied, original total unchanged\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_005\",\n    \"title\": \"Use reward points for discount\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has 1000 reward points ($10 value)\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Proceed to checkout\\n2. View reward points section\\n3. Check \'Use reward points\'\\n4. Slider to use all points\\n5. Verify $10 discount applied\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Points redeemed, $10 discount shown, points balance updated after order, remaining points: 0\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_006\",\n    \"title\": \"Order minimum amount boundary\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Cart total is exactly at minimum ($10)\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Set cart total to $10.00\\n2. Proceed to checkout\\n3. Attempt to place order\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order allowed, no minimum error, if cart < $10, error: \'Minimum order amount is $10.00\'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_007\",\n    \"title\": \"Payment failure - insufficient funds\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Credit card has very low balance\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Place order with total > card balance\\n2. Select credit card payment\\n3. Submit order\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Payment declined, error: \'Payment declined - insufficient funds\', order not created, retry with different payment offered\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_008\",\n    \"title\": \"Order with Cash on Delivery\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"COD is available for selected address and products\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Checkout with eligible items\\n2. Select \'Cash on Delivery\' option\\n3. Confirm order\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order created with COD status, no payment required now, COD fee (if any) included in total, confirmation shown\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_009\",\n    \"title\": \"Split payment with points and card\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has reward points, wants to split payment\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Checkout with order total $150\\n2. Select \'Use points\' ($50 value)\\n3. Select remaining payment by card\\n4. Complete payment\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Split payment successful, $50 from points, $100 from card, both transactions recorded, order complete\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_010\",\n    \"title\": \"Coupon usage limit reached\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Coupon \'SINGLEUSE\' already used by this account\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Try to apply coupon \'SINGLEUSE\'\\n2. Apply to new order\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Error: \'This coupon has already been used\', coupon usage history shown, suggests other available coupons\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Order cancellation before payment\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order created but payment not completed\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Add items and proceed to checkout\\n2. Fill address and payment method\\n3. Before confirming, click \'Cancel Order\'\\n4. Verify order status\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order cancelled, inventory released, no payment charged, redirected to cart with items intact\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Order cancellation after payment (refund test)\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order paid but not yet shipped\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Find paid order\\n2. Click \'Cancel Order\'\\n3. Select cancellation reason\\n4. Confirm cancellation\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order cancelled, refund initiated, refund to original payment method within 3-5 business days, confirmation email sent\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_013\",\n    \"title\": \"Partial order cancellation\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order has 3 items, only 1 needs cancellation\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View order details\\n2. Select 1 item to cancel\\n3. Submit partial cancellation\\n4. Check refund amount\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Only selected item cancelled, other items continue processing, partial refund calculated, remaining order unaffected\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_014\",\n    \"title\": \"Payment with gift card balance\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has $50 gift card balance, order total $80\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Checkout with items totaling $80\\n2. Apply gift card (covers $50)\\n3. Pay remaining $30 with credit card\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Split payment successful, gift card charged $50, card charged $30, both transactions recorded\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_015\",\n    \"title\": \"Order note/special instruction\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order supports special instructions\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Checkout process\\n2. Add order note: \'Please leave at door\'\\n3. Complete order\\n4. Verify note on order detail\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order note saved and displayed in order details, note visible to fulfillment team, not shown publicly\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_001\",\n    \"title\": \"Track order in shipped status\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order has been shipped with tracking number\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to \'My Orders\'\\n2. Find shipped order\\n3. Click \'Track Package\'\\n4. View tracking timeline\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Tracking page shows: order shipped, carrier info, current location, estimated delivery date, full timeline\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_002\",\n    \"title\": \"View in-transit package status\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Package is in transit\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Open tracking page\\n2. View current status\\n3. Check each checkpoint\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Multiple checkpoints displayed, current location highlighted, package arriving at facility shown, timestamps for each event\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_003\",\n    \"title\": \"Confirm package received\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order delivered, user has signed in app\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View delivered order\\n2. Click \'Confirm Receipt\'\\n3. Optionally rate delivery\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order status updated to \'Completed\', return window starts (if applicable), review prompt shown after confirmation\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_004\",\n    \"title\": \"Initiate return request\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order delivered within return window (7 days)\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to order details\\n2. Click \'Return/Refund\'\\n3. Select reason: \'Item not as described\'\\n4. Upload photos of issue\\n5. Submit request\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Return request submitted, RMA number generated, return shipping label provided, email confirmation sent, status: \'Return Pending\'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_005\",\n    \"title\": \"Track international shipment\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order shipped internationally with customs involved\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Track order shipped to another country\\n2. View customs status\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Customs clearance status shown, expected clearance date, duties/taxes information, local delivery partner details\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_006\",\n    \"title\": \"Delivery exception - address issue\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Package delivery attempted but failed\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Check tracking status\\n2. View exception details\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Exception shown: \'Delivery failed - incorrect address\', option to update address, retry delivery option, customer service contact\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_007\",\n    \"title\": \"Return after return window expired\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order delivered 30 days ago (return window: 7 days)\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Attempt to start return\\n2. Select return reason\\n3. Submit request\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Error: \'Return window has expired (7 days)\', return not allowed, option to contact customer service for exceptions\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_008\",\n    \"title\": \"Change delivery address after shipping\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order shipped but not yet delivered\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Attempt to modify address\\n2. Modify after order shipped\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Warning: \'Order already shipped, address change may not be possible\', redirect to modify if carrier allows intercept, otherwise customer service contact\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_009\",\n    \"title\": \"View return/refund status\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Return request submitted and in process\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to \'My Returns\'\\n2. View return status timeline\\n3. Check refund amount\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Return status: \'Item Received\', \'Refund Processing\', refund amount detailed, expected completion date\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_010\",\n    \"title\": \"Schedule delivery time slot\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Delivery service supports scheduling\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View tracking when out for delivery\\n2. Click \'Schedule Delivery\'\\n3. Select preferred date/time\\n4. Confirm\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Delivery rescheduled, confirmation shown, updated delivery window communicated via SMS/email\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Multiple packages in same order\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order contains items from different warehouses\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View order with multiple packages\\n2. Track each package separately\\n3. Verify all tracking numbers displayed\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order shows multiple tracking numbers, each package trackable independently, estimated delivery for each\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Delivery attempted - customer not home\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Package delivery attempted but recipient unavailable\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Check tracking status after failed delivery\\n2. View available options\\n3. Schedule redelivery or pickup\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Status shows \'Delivery attempted - no one home\', options: reschedule, pickup at location, reattempt next business day\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_013\",\n    \"title\": \"Package delivered to locker/pickup point\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Package sent to pickup locker\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Check tracking status\\n2. View pickup code/QR\\n3. Pick up package using code\\n4. Confirm collection\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Status shows \'Arrived at pickup point\', pickup code displayed, collection confirmed, receipt generated\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_014\",\n    \"title\": \"Return shipping label generation\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Return request approved\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View approved return\\n2. Download/print return label\\n3. View return instructions\\n4. Track return shipment\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Return label generated with QR/barcode, instructions provided, return tracking available, estimated refund timeline shown\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_015\",\n    \"title\": \"Package lost during transit\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Package shows no updates for extended period\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Track order after 7 days of no updates\\n2. Report package as lost\\n3. File claim with carrier\\n4. Contact customer service\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Claim process initiated, investigation opened, customer refunded or reshipped, compensation offered per policy\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_001\",\n    \"title\": \"Submit text review with 5-star rating\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has completed order, order delivered >1 day ago\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to \'My Orders\'\\n2. Find completed order\\n3. Click \'Write Review\'\\n4. Select 5 stars\\n5. Enter review text: \'Excellent product, fast delivery!\'\\n6. Submit review\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Review submitted successfully, review appears on product page, reward points credited, thank you message displayed\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_002\",\n    \"title\": \"Submit review with photos\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has completed order, can upload photos\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Start writing review\\n2. Rate 4 stars\\n3. Enter review text\\n4. Click \'Add Photos\'\\n5. Upload 3 product images\\n6. Submit\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Review with photos uploaded, photos display in review, image count badge shown, photos require moderation before public display\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_003\",\n    \"title\": \"Submit review without rating\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User attempting to submit incomplete review\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Write review text\\n2. Leave star rating at 0\\n3. Click submit\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Error: \'Please select a rating\', submit blocked, rating selection highlighted as required\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_004\",\n    \"title\": \"Review text character limit boundary\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User writing very long review\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Enter review text of 2000 characters\\n2. Verify character counter\\n3. Try to add 201st character\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Character limit shown, 2000 character maximum, input prevented at limit, remaining character count displayed\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_005\",\n    \"title\": \"Submit review for non-purchased item\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User attempting to review unverified purchase\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to random product page\\n2. Try to click \'Write Review\'\\n3. Attempt to submit\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"\'Write Review\' not available or redirects to order verification, only verified purchasers can review, verification badge required\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_006\",\n    \"title\": \"Edit submitted review\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has existing submitted review\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to \'My Reviews\'\\n2. Find existing review\\n3. Click \'Edit\'\\n4. Modify text\\n5. Save changes\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Review updated, \'Edited\' tag shown, edit timestamp recorded, original text accessible via history\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_007\",\n    \"title\": \"Submit review with only special characters\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User attempting to submit invalid review\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Write review with only: @#$%^&*()\\n2. Select rating\\n3. Submit\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Warning or rejection: \'Please provide meaningful review text\', or content filtered, minimum word requirement enforced\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_008\",\n    \"title\": \"Upload invalid image format for review\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User trying to upload unsupported file type\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Write review\\n2. Try to upload .exe or .pdf file\\n3. Attempt submit\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"File rejected, error: \'Only JPG, PNG images allowed, max 5MB per image\', only valid images accepted\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_009\",\n    \"title\": \"Helpful vote on review\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User viewing product reviews\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Find review on product page\\n2. Click \'Helpful\' button\\n3. Verify count increases\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Vote recorded, helpful count +1, button shows \'Voted\', user\'s voting history tracked to prevent duplicates\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_010\",\n    \"title\": \"Report inappropriate review\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User viewing another user\'s review\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Find suspicious review\\n2. Click \'Report\'\\n3. Select reason: \'Spam\'\\n4. Submit report\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Report submitted, confirmation shown, review flagged for moderation, reporter anonymity protected\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Review moderation - profanity filter\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User attempting to submit review with profanity\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Write review containing profanity words\\n2. Submit review\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Review blocked or profanity masked with asterisks, warning: \'Please keep your review appropriate\', or review held for moderation\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Review - video upload\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Review system supports video uploads\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Write review\\n2. Click \'Add Video\'\\n3. Upload video (30 seconds, MP4 format)\\n4. Submit\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Video uploaded and processed, thumbnail shown, video playable in review, file size limit: 100MB, duration: up to 60 seconds\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_013\",\n    \"title\": \"Review visibility after submission\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Review submitted and pending moderation\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Submit review\\n2. Check if review appears immediately\\n3. Check user\'s \'My Reviews\' section\\n4. Check product page after moderation\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Review shows as \'Pending\' in My Reviews, not visible on product page until approved, notification when published\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_014\",\n    \"title\": \"Seller response to review\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Product has new review\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Seller views new review\\n2. Clicks \'Reply\'\\n3. Enters response\\n4. Submits\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Seller response attached to review, visible below original review, timestamp recorded, customer can reply back\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"REV_015\",\n    \"title\": \"Delete own review\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has submitted review\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to \'My Reviews\'\\n2. Click \'Delete\' on review\\n3. Confirm deletion\\n4. Verify review removed\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Review deleted, rating/review count on product updated, no longer visible to other users, deletion logged\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_001\",\n    \"title\": \"Start live chat with customer service\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User needs assistance, chat agents available\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Click \'Customer Service\' or chat icon\\n2. Start new chat session\\n3. Select topic: Order Inquiry\\n4. Type message: \'Where is my order?\'\\n5. Wait for agent response\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Connected to agent, chat interface loads, queue position shown, agent responds within SLA (30 seconds), conversation logged\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_002\",\n    \"title\": \"Submit support ticket\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User needs help with complex issue\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to Customer Service\\n2. Click \'Submit Ticket\'\\n3. Select category: \'Refund Request\'\\n4. Select order\\n5. Enter subject and description\\n6. Attach screenshot\\n7. Submit ticket\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Ticket created with ID, confirmation email sent, estimated response time shown, can track ticket status\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_003\",\n    \"title\": \"Search FAQ for common question\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User is on FAQ page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to Help Center\\n2. Click FAQ section\\n3. Search: \'how to return\'\\n4. View result\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"FAQ articles displayed matching \'return\', articles ranked by relevance, helpfulness rating available for each\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_004\",\n    \"title\": \"Upload attachment in chat\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Active chat session\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. In chat, click attachment icon\\n2. Upload image of issue\\n3. Send\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Image uploaded and visible in chat, support agent can view, file type/size validation applied\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_005\",\n    \"title\": \"Chat timeout - no response\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User waiting in chat queue for extended time\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Start chat session\\n2. Wait beyond expected wait time (30 min)\\n3. No agent response\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"System prompt: \'All agents are busy, please leave a message or try again later\', option to leave callback number\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_006\",\n    \"title\": \"Submit ticket with missing required fields\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User submitting incomplete ticket\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Start ticket submission\\n2. Skip required subject field\\n3. Try to submit\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Error: \'Subject is required\', form not submitted, required fields highlighted, previously entered data preserved\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_007\",\n    \"title\": \"Rate chat support experience\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Chat session ended\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Chat conversation ends\\n2. Rating prompt appears\\n3. Select 5 stars and type comment\\n4. Submit\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Rating recorded, thank you message displayed, feedback used for agent performance tracking\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_008\",\n    \"title\": \"View ticket history\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has submitted previous tickets\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to \'My Support Tickets\'\\n2. View ticket list\\n3. Click on resolved ticket\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"All tickets listed with status (Open, In Progress, Resolved), full conversation history visible for each ticket\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_009\",\n    \"title\": \"Live chat outside operating hours\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Attempting chat outside 24/7 service window\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to chat during non-operating hours\\n2. Try to start chat\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Message: \'Live chat available 9AM-9PM. Please leave a message and we\'ll respond within 24 hours.\', option to submit ticket instead\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_010\",\n    \"title\": \"Escalate ticket to supervisor\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Ticket unresolved after initial support response\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Reply to ticket\\n2. Request escalation\\n3. Explain reason for escalation\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Ticket escalated, priority raised, supervisor notification sent, estimated response time reduced, escalation history logged\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Transfer from chatbot to human agent\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User in chatbot conversation\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Chat with bot\\n2. Type \'Agent\' or \'Human\'\\n3. Request transfer\\n4. Wait for agent\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Escalated to human agent, conversation history preserved, agent greeted with context, seamless transition\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Attach order to ticket automatically\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has order ID, submitting ticket related to order\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Start ticket from order detail page\\n2. Verify order ID pre-filled\\n3. Add description\\n4. Submit\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order ID automatically linked, agent sees order details immediately, faster resolution\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_013\",\n    \"title\": \"Callback request outside chat\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User doesn\'t want to wait in chat queue\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Click \'Request Callback\'\\n2. Enter phone number\\n3. Select preferred time\\n4. Confirm request\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Callback scheduled, confirmation shown with time, callback received at specified time, ticket created automatically\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_014\",\n    \"title\": \"Self-service refund request\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User eligible for self-service refund\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to order details\\n2. Click \'Request Refund\'\\n3. Select items and reason\\n4. Submit request\\n5. Receive refund confirmation\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Refund processed automatically for eligible items, status updated to \'Refund Processing\', refund timeline shown\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CS_015\",\n    \"title\": \"Product inquiry via chat\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has product question\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Start chat\\n2. Ask about product availability\\n3. Ask about specs\\n4. Request link to product\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Agent provides accurate information, shares product link, chat logged for quality assurance\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_001\",\n    \"title\": \"View order history\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User logged in with order history\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Click user avatar\\n2. Select \'My Orders\'\\n3. View list of orders\\n4. Filter by status: \'Completed\'\\n5. Click on specific order\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Orders displayed chronologically, filter works correctly, order details include items, payment, status, tracking, dates\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_002\",\n    \"title\": \"Add new shipping address\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has existing addresses, wants to add new\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to \'My Addresses\'\\n2. Click \'Add New Address\'\\n3. Fill: Name, Phone, Province, City, District, Street\\n4. Set as default\\n5. Save\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Address saved successfully, appears in address list, default badge shown if set, can set up to 20 addresses\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_003\",\n    \"title\": \"Edit existing address\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has saved addresses\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View address list\\n2. Click \'Edit\' on existing address\\n3. Change phone number\\n4. Save\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Address updated, confirmation shown, changes reflected in checkout addresses, default status preserved if applicable\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_004\",\n    \"title\": \"Delete address with default protection\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has 3+ addresses, one is default\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Try to delete default address\\n2. Confirm deletion\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Warning: \'This is your default address. Please set another default first.\', deletion prevented, prompt to change default first\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_005\",\n    \"title\": \"Change account password\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User logged in, knows current password\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to \'Account Security\'\\n2. Click \'Change Password\'\\n3. Enter current password\\n4. Enter new password: NewPass123\\n5. Confirm new password\\n6. Submit\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Password changed successfully, confirmation email sent, all other sessions logged out, require re-login\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_006\",\n    \"title\": \"Enable two-factor authentication\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User in account security settings\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to security settings\\n2. Click \'Enable 2FA\'\\n3. Scan QR code with authenticator app\\n4. Enter verification code\\n5. Save backup codes\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"2FA enabled, backup codes saved, next login requires verification code, success notification shown\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_007\",\n    \"title\": \"Update profile information\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User wants to update profile\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to \'My Profile\'\\n2. Edit: Nickname, Gender, Birthday\\n3. Upload new avatar\\n4. Save changes\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Profile updated, changes reflected immediately, avatar updated across platform, profile completeness percentage increased\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_008\",\n    \"title\": \"Delete account - boundary case\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User attempting account deletion with pending orders\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to account settings\\n2. Find \'Delete Account\'\\n3. Initiate deletion\\n4. Account has 2 active orders\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Block deletion: \'Cannot delete account with active orders. Please complete or cancel pending orders first.\' or: \'Your account deletion request has been submitted and will be processed after orders are complete\'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_009\",\n    \"title\": \"View reward points history\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has accumulated points\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to \'My Points\' or \'Rewards\'\\n2. View current balance\\n3. Filter by date range\\n4. Check transaction history\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Current balance displayed prominently, transaction list shows: earned from purchases, earned from reviews, redeemed, points summary by month\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_010\",\n    \"title\": \"Maximum addresses limit reached\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has 20 addresses (maximum limit)\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Try to add 21st address\\n2. Click \'Save\'\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Error: \'Maximum 20 addresses allowed. Please delete an address to add a new one.\', new address not saved\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Forgot password - reset flow\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User cannot login, forgot password\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Click \'Forgot Password\'\\n2. Enter registered email: test@example.com\\n3. Click \'Send Reset Link\'\\n4. Open email\\n5. Click reset link\\n6. Set new password\\n7. Login with new password\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Reset link sent to email, link valid for 24 hours, password reset successful, login with new password works\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_012\",\n    \"title\": \"Email verification for sensitive changes\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User changing sensitive info like email\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to change email\\n2. Enter new email\\n3. Submit\\n4. Verify via new email link\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Verification email sent to new address, old email also notified, change only effective after verification\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_013\",\n    \"title\": \"Session timeout warning\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User logged in but inactive\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Login and stay idle\\n2. Wait for session timeout threshold\\n3. Verify warning appears\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Warning modal: \'Your session will expire in 2 minutes. Click to stay logged in or logout.\', session extended on interaction\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_014\",\n    \"title\": \"Export order history to CSV\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User on order history page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Click \'Export Orders\'\\n2. Select date range\\n3. Choose format: CSV\\n4. Download file\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"CSV downloaded with order data including: order ID, date, items, total, status, file contains all selected orders\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_015\",\n    \"title\": \"Guest checkout conversion to account\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User completed checkout as guest without account\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Complete guest checkout\\n2. Receive email with account creation prompt\\n3. Click link in email\\n4. Set password\\n5. Login\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Guest order linked to new account, order history accessible, welcome email sent, order status notifications enabled\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_016\",\n    \"title\": \"Privacy settings management\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User in privacy settings\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to Privacy settings\\n2. Toggle \'Show purchase history publicly\'\\n3. Toggle \'Allow marketing emails\'\\n4. Save changes\\n5. Verify settings applied\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Privacy preferences saved, confirmation shown, marketing emails adjusted, profile visibility updated accordingly\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_017\",\n    \"title\": \"Notification preferences configuration\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User managing notifications\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to Notification Settings\\n2. Enable order updates via SMS\\n3. Disable promotional push notifications\\n4. Set quiet hours: 10PM-8AM\\n5. Save\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Notification preferences saved, test notification sent for verification, quiet hours respected, changes take effect immediately\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_018\",\n    \"title\": \"Linked payment methods management\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has linked payment methods\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Go to Payment Methods\\n2. View list of cards\\n3. Add new credit card\\n4. Delete existing card\\n5. Set default payment\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"New card added with verification, deleted card removed, default card marked, max 5 cards limit enforced\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_019\",\n    \"title\": \"Account merge functionality\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has duplicate accounts\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Contact customer service for account merge\\n2. Verify ownership of both accounts\\n3. Select primary account\\n4. Merge accounts\\n5. Verify combined data\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Orders, points, addresses merged into primary account, secondary account closed, single login for merged account\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_020\",\n    \"title\": \"View account activity log\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User wants security overview\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to Account Security\\n2. Click \'Activity Log\'\\n3. View recent logins\\n4. Check for suspicious activity\\n5. Log out specific session\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Activity log shows: login time, device, IP location, session management options, ability to revoke suspicious sessions\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"SEC_001\",\n    \"title\": \"SQL injection in search field\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User on search page\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Enter: \' OR \'1\'=\'1\\n2. Submit search\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Input sanitized, no database error, search returns normal results or empty, no sensitive data exposed\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"SEC_002\",\n    \"title\": \"XSS attack in review text\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User writing review\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Enter: <script>alert(\'xss\')</script> in review\\n2. Submit review\\n3. View review on product page\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Script not executed, HTML escaped, review displayed as text, no XSS vulnerability\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"SEC_003\",\n    \"title\": \"CSRF protection on payment submission\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User submitting payment\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Capture payment request with token\\n2. Attempt to replay without proper session\\n3. Submit payment with reused token\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Request rejected, CSRF token validated, session verified, replay attack prevented\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"SEC_004\",\n    \"title\": \"Brute force protection on login\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Attacker attempting multiple password guesses\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Attempt 100 login failures rapidly\\n2. From different IP addresses\\n3. Try to continue after lockout\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Account locked after 5 failed attempts, IP temporarily blocked, captcha required, no successful login achieved\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"SEC_005\",\n    \"title\": \"Sensitive data encryption verification\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User account data in database\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Check database storage for passwords\\n2. Verify password hashing (not plain text)\\n3. Check credit card data encryption\\n4. Verify HTTPS on all pages\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Passwords stored as hashed values (bcrypt/argon2), credit card data encrypted (AES-256), HTTPS enforced on all endpoints\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"SEC_006\",\n    \"title\": \"IDOR - unauthorized order access\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has order ID 12345\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Login and view own order 12345\\n2. Try to access order 99999 (belongs to other user)\\n3. Modify URL to try direct access\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Access denied for unauthorized order, 403 Forbidden returned, no sensitive data leaked, attempts logged\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"SEC_007\",\n    \"title\": \"Rate limiting on API endpoints\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Testing API rate limits\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Make 100 API requests in 1 minute\\n2. Continue making requests\\n3. Exceed rate limit\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Rate limit enforced: 429 Too Many Requests returned, retry-after header present, requests blocked until limit resets\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"SEC_008\",\n    \"title\": \"File upload vulnerability\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Image upload functionality\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Upload file with double extension: image.jpg.php\\n2. Upload webshell disguised as image\\n3. Try to execute uploaded file\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Upload rejected or file renamed, executable extensions blocked, content-type validated, files stored outside webroot\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n鎮ㄧ殑JSON鏁扮粍宸茬粡瀹屾暣涓旀纭棴鍚堜簡銆傛暟缁勪互 `]` 缁撴潫锛屽叡鍖呭惈 **92涓祴璇曠敤渚?*锛屾棤闇€缁х画杈撳嚭銆俓n\n濡傛灉鎮ㄩ渶瑕侊紝鎴戝皢涓烘偍杈撳嚭涔嬪墠澹版槑鐨?*琛ュ厖娴嬭瘯鐢ㄤ緥**锛圓UTH_011-AUTH_015銆丳ROD_011-PROD_015绛夛級锛岃纭鏄惁闇€瑕侊細\n\n1. **浠呰緭鍑鸿ˉ鍏呯敤渚?*锛堜笉鍖