ck \'Forgot Password\' link on login page\\n2. Enter registered email: test@example.com\\n3. Click \'Send Reset Link\'\\n4. Check email inbox\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Reset link sent successfully, email received with subject \'Password Reset Request\', link included in email, link valid for 24 hours, confirmation message displayed on page\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_011b\",\n    \"title\": \"Reset password via email link\",\n    \"module\": \"User Center\",\n    \"test_type\": \"Functional\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"designer\": \"QA Team\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User received valid password reset email within 24 hours\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Open password reset email\\n2. Click reset link\\n3. Enter new password: NewPass123\\n4. Confirm new password\\n5. Click \'Submit\'\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Password reset successful, confirmation message \'Password has been reset\', link expires after single use, redirect to login page\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_011c\",\n    \"title\": \"Login with new password after reset\",\n    \"module\": \"User Center\",\n    \"test_type\": \"Functional\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"designer\": \"QA Team\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User has completed password reset, received confirmation email\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to login page\\n2. Enter registered phone: 13800138000\\n3. Enter new password: NewPass123\\n4. Click \'Login\'\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Login successful with new password, redirect to homepage, session created, old password no longer works\"\n  }\n]\n```\n鏍规嵁璇勫鎰忚鏀硅繘鍚庣殑娴嬭瘯鐢ㄤ緥锛圝SON鏁扮粍鏍煎紡锛夛細\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_009\",\n    \"title\": \"Account locked after failed attempts\",\n    \"module\": \"Authentication\",\n    \"test_type\": \"Security\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"designer\": \"QA Team\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User account exists, no prior failed attempts\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to login page\\