iled attempt: warning displayed \'Incorrect password, 1 attempt remaining before lockout\', submit button still enabled. After 6th failed attempt: account temporarily locked for 30 minutes, error message \'Account temporarily locked due to multiple failed attempts\', user cannot retry during lockout period\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"AUTH_009b\",\n    \"title\": \"Captcha appears after consecutive login failures\",\n    \"module\": \"Authentication\",\n    \"test_type\": \"Security\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"designer\": \"QA Team\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User account exists, no prior failed attempts\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to login page\\n2. Enter registered phone: 13800138000\\n3. Enter wrong password\\n4. Repeat step 3 two more times (total 3 failures)\\n5. Attempt 4th login\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Captcha challenge appears after 3 consecutive failed attempts, login form requires captcha completion before 4th attempt can be submitted, remaining attempts still tracked (2 remaining before lockout)\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"PROD_005\",\n    \"title\": \"Verify product detail page content completeness\",\n    \"module\": \"Product\",\n    \"test_type\": \"Functional\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"designer\": \"QA Team\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User is on product listing page with at least one in-stock product\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Click on any product thumbnail\\n2. Wait for product detail page to fully load (all images and content)\\n3. Scroll to view all page sections\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Product detail page displays all required elements: (1) Product name - matches listing title exactly, (2) Price - currency symbol present, accurate to 2 decimal places, (3) Product images - thumbnail gallery displayed, main image visible, zoom function available, (4) Description - product highlights and detailed information visible, (5) Specifications - size, weight, materials, color options listed, (6) Stock status - \'In Stock\'/\'Low Stock\'/\'Out of Stock\' with quantity indicator if applicable, (7) Reviews section - average rating with star display, total review count, verified purchaser badge, (8) Add to Cart button - enabled and clickable for in-stock items\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_003\",\n    \"title\": \"Remove single item from cart with multiple items\",\n    \"module\": \"Shopping Cart\",\n    \"test_type\": \"Functional\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"designer\": \"QA Team\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Cart contains exactly 2 items with different prices (Item A: $50, Item B: $30), total displayed as $80\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View shopping cart page\\n2. Identify first item (Item A) and note its price ($50)\\n3. Click delete/trash icon on first item\\n4. Confirm deletion in popup dialog\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Item A removed from cart, remaining item count: 1 (only Item B), cart total updated to $30, confirmation toast: \'Item removed from cart\', cart badge decremented by 1, removed item no longer appears in cart item list\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"CART_008\",\n    \"title\": \"Cart maximum item limit boundary test\",\n    \"module\": \"Shopping Cart\",\n    \"test_type\": \"Boundary\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"designer\": \"QA Team\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Cart currently has 99 items (system max limit is 100 items per user)\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. View cart and verify badge shows 99 items\\n2. Navigate to a new product page\\n3. Click \'Add to Cart\' to add 1 item\\n4. Verify cart count updates to 100\\n5. Navigate to another product and attempt to add another item\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"After step 3 (adding 100th item): success message shown \'Item added to cart\', cart badge shows 100. After step 5 (attempting to add 101st item): error message \'Cart limit reached (max 100 items)\', item not added, cart count remains at 100, suggestion displayed: \'Please checkout or remove items to add more\'\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"ORD_006\",\n    \"title\": \"Order minimum amount boundary validation\",\n    \"module\": \"Order\",\n    \"test_type\": \"Boundary\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"designer\": \"QA Team\",\n    \"precondition\": \"System minimum order amount is $10.00, test data prepared for two scenarios\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Add items to cart totaling exactly $10.00\\n2. Proceed to checkout\\n3. Review order summary displays subtotal: $10.00, tax: calculated, total: $10.00\\n4. Click \'Place Order\' button\\n5. (If applicable) Create order with total $9.99 and attempt checkout\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Scenario 1 - Total exactly $10.00: Order allowed, \'Place Order\' clickable, order placed successfully, no minimum error displayed. Scenario 2 - Total $9.99: Error message \'Minimum order amount is $10.00\', checkout blocked, \'Place Order\' button disabled, prompt: \'Add $0.01 more to meet minimum order requirement\'\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_003\",\n    \"title\": \"Confirm package receipt\",\n    \"module\": \"Logistics\",\n    \"test_type\": \"Functional\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"designer\": \"QA Team\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order status is \'Delivered\' (delivery completed within last 7 days)\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to \'My Orders\'\\n2. Find order with status \'Delivered\'\\n3. Click \'Confirm Receipt\' button\\n4. Confirm action in dialog\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Order status updated to \'Completed\', delivery confirmation timestamp recorded in order history, return/refund window initiated (7-day return window starts from current date), thank you message displayed, review prompt shown\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_003b\",\n    \"title\": \"Rate delivery experience after confirmation\",\n    \"module\": \"Logistics\",\n    \"test_type\": \"Functional\",\n    \"priority\": \"P2\",\n    \"designer\": \"QA Team\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order delivery just confirmed, user on confirmation screen\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. After confirming receipt, rate delivery prompt appears\\n2. Select star rating (1-5 stars)\\n3. Optionally add text comment\\n4. Click \'Submit Rating\' button\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Rating recorded successfully, delivery rating summary updated, delivery person name shown if available, rating contributes to delivery personnel performance tracking, confirmation message displayed: \'Thank you for your feedback, your rating helps us improve delivery service\'\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"LOG_007\",\n    \"title\": \"Return request after return window expired\",\n    \"module\": \"Logistics\",\n    \"test_type\": \"Exception\",\n    \"priority\": \"P1\",\n    \"designer\": \"QA Team\",\n    \"precondition\": \"Order delivered 31 days ago (return window is 7 days from delivery date, so 24 days beyond window)\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Navigate to order details page\\n2. Click \'Return/Refund\' button\\n3. Select return reason from dropdown\\n4. Click \'Submit Return Request\'\",\n    \"expected_result\": \"Error message displayed: \'Return window has expired. Returns are only accepted within 7 days of delivery. Your order was delivered on [original delivery date], return window closed on [window close date].\' Return option button disabled or hidden after window expiration, link to \'Contact Customer Service\' for exceptional cases displayed\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"case_id\": \"USR_011\",\n    \"title\": \"Request password reset link via email\",\n    \"module\": \"User Center\",\n    \"test_type\": \"Functional\",\n    \"priority\": \"P0\",\n    \"designer\": \"QA Team\",\n    \"precondition\": \"User cannot login to account, has access to registered email address: test@example.com\",\n    \"test_steps\": \"1. Click \'Forgot Password\' link on login page\\n2. Enter registered email: test@example.com\\n3. Click \'Send Reset Link\' button\\n4. Check email inbox (including spam folder)\",\n    \"expecte